  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Gambia &#x2013; Strengthening Civil Society Capacity for Inclusive and Transparent Elections 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project empowers civil society actors in The Gambia to play a more effective role in ensuring an inclusive, peaceful, and transparent 2026 Presential election.   Through targeted capacity-building, technical assistance, and coordinated advocacy, the initiative will build CSOs&#x2019; ability to monitor electoral processes, promote human rights, engage marginalised groups, and contribute to evidence&#x2013;based election reforms.</narrative>
  </description>
